# Copy to .streamlit/secrets.toml for local dev, or paste into Streamlit Cloud
# dashboard under Settings → Secrets.

# ── MotherDuck (recommended for Streamlit Cloud) ──────────────────────────────
# Sign up at https://motherduck.com, then:
#   1. Create a database called "energy" (or any name)
#   2. Run ingestion.py with MOTHERDUCK_TOKEN set so DuckDB writes to md:energy
#   3. Add the token below

